    "talks": [
        {
            "id": "37701",
            "objective": "Leave Tavern",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "37702",
            "objective": "Return to the tavern the following night",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "3770201",
                    "speaker": "Venti",
                    "text": "You're here."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3770202",
                    "speaker": "Jean",
                    "text": "#Wait, you're... {NICKNAME}?",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "3770203",
                            "text": "...Jean?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "3770205",
                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                    "text": "Well, first of all, I contacted more than one person."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770206",
                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                    "text": "Secondly, she came here as \"Jean\" herself, not as the Acting Grand Master."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770207",
                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                    "text": "A Jean you would never see, even as an Honorary Knight."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770208",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "What a surprise."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770209",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "I heard about the Holy Lyre, but I never suspected it was you."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770210",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "So, the sound of the Holy Lyre can purify Stormterror and return it to normal... Is that true?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770211",
                                    "speaker": "Venti",
                                    "text": "#That's right! {NICKNAME} is putting themselves on the front line to try and resolve this Stormterror issue."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770212",
                                    "speaker": "Venti",
                                    "text": "Now that's the hotshot of the Knights of Favonius I'm talking about."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770213",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Feels like we're breaking the law though..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770214",
                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                    "text": "I understand this kind of absurd explanation is hard to believe."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770215",
                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                    "text": "But, we can ask the bard to play the song again to try and persuade—"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770216",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "I believe you."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770217",
                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                    "text": "To persuade our stubborn comman— Wait, what?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770218",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "I can't think of any reason for Dvalin's betrayal, given it was once one of The Four Winds."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770219",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "However, if it was poisoned in the battle over Mondstadt all those years ago..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770220",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "And then corrupted by the Abyss Mage after it woke up — we can't really blame it."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770221",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "But as Acting Grand Master I obviously cannot make such a statement publicly."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770222",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "Diplomatic pressure from the Fatui makes it hard for us to seek a peaceful resolution to the Stormterror issue."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770223",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "People would think I've lost grip on the gravity of the situation. That's why I can only do this in private."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770224",
                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                    "text": "Hmph."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770225",
                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                    "text": "That's one of the reasons I don't like the Knights of Favonius."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770226",
                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                    "text": "What surprises me is that you would believe an outlander so easily..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770227",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "#My cautious and meticulous <color=#00E1FFFF>superior</color>, even you trust {M#him}{F#her}. Don't you, sir?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3770228",
                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                    "text": "I already told you not to call me sir... Never mind. We don't often get to work together after all.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "3770229",
                                            "text": "Sir?",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "3770231",
                                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                                    "text": "..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "3770232",
                                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                                    "text": "..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "3770233",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Wow! Um... This is really awkward..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "3770234",
                                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                                    "text": "I have a rough idea of where the Holy Lyre der Himmel is."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "3770235",
                                                    "speaker": "Venti",
                                                    "text": "(Nice recovery! She's really talented at changing the subject...)"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "3770236",
                                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                                    "text": "The conflict between Mondstadt and Snezhnaya stems from the conflict between the seven nations and their respective gods."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "3770237",
                                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                                    "text": "The Cryo God's Fatui seem to be after the Anemo God's power."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "3770238",
                                                    "speaker": "Venti",
                                                    "text": "...",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "3770239",
                                                            "text": "So are they going to take over the defense of Mondstadt?",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "3770241",
                                                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                                                    "text": "Right."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "3770242",
                                                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                                                    "text": "If the Knights of Favonius publicly prevented an attempt on Dvalin's head, then..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "3770243",
                                                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                                                    "text": "The only other way to affect the Anemo God's power is to take the Holy Lyre."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "3770244",
                                                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                                                    "text": "The number of Fatui that have come to Mondstadt is far from limited."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "3770245",
                                                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                                                    "text": "I've already managed to... coerce a few reports out of them."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "3770246",
                                                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                                                    "text": "Diluc has determined that the Holy Lyre is not being held in the Goth Grand Hotel."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "3770247",
                                                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                                                    "text": "I imagine they don't want to leave something stolen in a place where it could be so easily found."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "3770248",
                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                    "text": "Paimon gets it. If too much of a scene gets made then it becomes a big diplomatic issue."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "3770249",
                                                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                                                    "text": "Hmph, such is the diplomacy between the seven nations."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "3770250",
                                                                    "speaker": "Diluc",
                                                                    "text": "Outlander, ready to go?"
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "3770240",
                                                            "text": "So they want to kill Dvalin?"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "3770230",
                                            "text": "(Pretend to not have heard anything)"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "3770204",
                            "text": "Why is the Acting Grand Master here?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
